arktos (1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebrand to Arktos: the project formerly developed as Arora ships
    its first release as Arktos 1.0 (arktos-browser.com). Binary,
    install paths (/usr/lib/arktos, /usr/share/arktos), desktop file,
    icons and user data roots renamed; existing Arora config/data is
    migrated on first run.

 -- Arktos Developers <devin@cognition.ai>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 21:30:00 +0200

